Description: Native supplementary artifacts without Codex session or conversation content
Author: Anonymous artifact collection
Version: 1.0
Id: 06deee69-2daf-452a-81df-cc3f210394e0
RecreateDirectories: true
Targets:
    -
        Name: Codex package PowerShell native startup profile
        Category: ProgramExecution
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Local\Packages\OpenAI.Codex_*\LocalCache\Local\Microsoft\PowerShell\
        FileMask: StartupProfileData-NonInteractive
        Recursive: false
        Comment: Binary native startup profile; absence without collection is outside scope. ModuleAnalysisCache is not a substitute.
    -
        Name: Codex package manifest
        Category: Apps
        Path: C:\Program Files\WindowsApps\OpenAI.Codex_*\
        FileMask: AppxManifest.xml
        Recursive: false
        Comment: Package identity and manifest version, not an execution time.
    -
        Name: Defender native Store
        Category: Antivirus
        Path: C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Windows Defender\Scans\History\Store\
        Recursive: true
        Comment: Native process history Store. Specialized parser required; do not treat scanned paths as process images.
    -
        Name: Windows Search databases and companion files
        Category: FileKnowledge
        Path: C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Search\Data\Applications\Windows\
        Recursive: false
        Comment: Includes Windows.edb or Windows.db and Windows-gather.db with journal/checkpoint companions; parse working copies only.
    -
        Name: Windows Search per-user databases and companion files
        Category: FileKnowledge
        Path: C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Search\Data\Applications\S-1*\
        Recursive: false
        Comment: Per-user Search location from the installed WindowsIndexSearch target.
